22
00:01:19,890 --> 00:01:25,720
So it feels really good. So I went there and then went all the way to Dallas.

23
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:28,733
The first match was against the US.

24
00:01:28,813 --> 00:01:30,576
Extremely hot weather.

25
