38
00:02:09,290 --> 00:02:12,210
I understand people give love.

39
00:02:12,290 --> 00:02:15,210
But my whole experience was wasted.

40
00:02:15,290 --> 00:02:16,210
I couldn't see the game.

41
00:02:16,290 --> 00:02:18,210
There was nothing worth seeing in the US game.

42
00:02:18,290 --> 00:02:20,290
Then headed over to New York.

43
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:24,401
The weather was great in New York.

44
00:02:24,481 --> 00:02:26,236
Very pleasant.

45
00:02:26,316 --> 00:02:30,480
It was not cold but it was windy and nice.

46
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,859
It was raining, you might remember.

47
00:02:32,939 --> 00:02:34,844
Thank God it was not raining.

48
00:02:34,924 --> 00:02:37,880
Otherwise we would have wasted all the money.

49
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:44,360
We did waste it but at least we watched the game. Pakistan won the match.

50
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:48,200
Literally, we were surrounded by Indian fans.

51
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,480
throughout the stadium.

52
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,880
And this always happens.

53
