202
00:11:52,590 --> 00:11:54,590
Alright, the first question is very interesting.

203
00:11:55,510 --> 00:11:57,670
Why is there no Pakistani Dhruv Rati?

204
00:11:57,950 --> 00:12:05,630
This question was going around on Twitter the other day and then local podcasters were being dragged around saying that on one side there is this and on the other side there is that.

205
00:12:06,030 --> 00:12:13,310
Then Syed Muzamil Shah made a very detailed video which was very relevant as well and I agree to a lot of points.

206
00:12:13,750 --> 00:12:17,110
There are many things that I want to say.

207
00:12:17,570 --> 00:12:23,196
I sort of held a torch to Sayyid Muzammil that you say these things,

208
00:12:23,276 --> 00:12:24,990
I don't want to do it.

209
00:12:25,070 --> 00:12:28,870
There are so many things that happen in Pakistan and it's not safe to talk about a lot of things.

210
00:12:28,950 --> 00:12:35,230
So I sort of said yes, I don't want to give my life for these people. I don't want to become a hero.

211
00:12:35,310 --> 00:12:41,270
So Muzammil talks about a lot of things that I talk to myself internally.

212
00:12:41,350 --> 00:12:45,310
And I wish there was space in Pakistan, safe enough that you can say those things.

213
00:12:45,390 --> 00:12:46,117
but clearly not.

214
00:12:46,197 --> 00:12:47,781
So let's move on to the question.

215
00:12:47,861 --> 00:12:50,966
Concern over lack of educational YouTubers in our community.

216
00:12:51,046 --> 00:12:52,025
Greetings of the day.

217
00:12:52,105 --> 00:12:53,868
I hope you're in good health.

218
00:12:53,948 --> 00:12:55,662
I will jump straight to the point.

219
00:12:55,742 --> 00:12:58,797
I have few concerns that I would like to discuss at length.

220
00:12:58,877 --> 00:13:04,591
Our YouTube community is overwhelmingly filled with cringe content creators with only a few exceptions.

221
00:13:04,671 --> 00:13:06,688
You're among top 1% of those exceptions.

222
00:13:06,768 --> 00:13:07,596
Thank you so much.

223
00:13:07,676 --> 00:13:12,425
While I understand that YouTube is a business and content creators are there to earn money,

224
00:13:12,505 --> 00:13:18,350
I can't help but notice that across the border, numerous YouTubers are focused on educating and informing their audience.

225
00:13:18,430 --> 00:13:24,990
